  "summary": "I ran CRC outreach under RBC-QM-02 for the group \"Okafor CRC 2026\" (14 members). The measurement period is calendar 2026, and ages are as of 12/31/2026. Six patients had open gaps; each now has a new mailed FIT kit order (LAB-FIT-KIT, window 10/23 to 12/31/2026) and an outreach message about that order. Pt-0024 also has an open gap, but she already had an active FIT order, so I placed no second order.\n\n| Patient | Age at end of 2026 | Status | Reason / action |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| pt-0009 Elly Trantow | 72 | Excluded | Age 66 or older, frailty active since 9/2025, and on a dementia drug (donepezil since 6/2025, still active). |\n| pt-0011 Marilu Gaona | 76 | Not in population | Over 75 at the end of 2026 (born 11/20/1950). |\n| pt-0014 Santo Pagac | 55 | Screening up to date | Colonoscopy 5/21/2018, within the 2017–2026 window. |\n| pt-0017 Stephan Herman | 54 | Open gap | Last colonoscopy 11/15/2016 is before the 2017 cutoff. Ordered FIT sr-t0001 and sent message comm-t0007. |\n| pt-0018 Lance Muller | 53 | Open gap | Stool DNA-FIT 11/20/2023 is before the 2024 cutoff. Ordered FIT sr-t0002 and sent message comm-t0008. |\n| pt-0019 Harrison O'Keefe | 69 | Open gap | No screening on record. Frailty is active, but there is no advanced illness or dementia drug, so he is not excluded. Ordered FIT sr-t0003 and sent message comm-t0009. |\n| pt-0020 Kelsie Rohan | 52 | Excluded | Active hospice care since 8/20/2026 (pancreatic cancer). |\n| pt-0021 Ángela Vigil | 52 | Excluded | Total proctocolectomy 6/3/2015 (outside operative report). |\n| pt-0022 Tiny Koss | 52 | Open gap | FIT 12/3/2025 was in 2025; FIT only counts if done in 2026. Ordered FIT sr-t0004 and sent message comm-t0010. |\n| pt-0023 Burma Leuschke | 46 | Open gap | Turns 46 on 12/15/2026, so she is in the population. No screening on record. Ordered FIT sr-t0005 and sent message comm-t0011. |\n| pt-0024 Delaine MacGyver | 51 | Open gap (FIT already ordered) | Her only stool test was 6/2024, which doesn't count for 2026. She has an active FIT order from 9/30/2026 (sr-t3-6648, due by 11/30), so I placed no new order. |\n| pt-0025 Danika Ullrich | 51 | Screening up to date | CT colonography 3/8/2022, within the 2022–2026 window. |\n| pt-0034 Rickey Sipes | 72 | Excluded | Age 66 or older and lives long term in a nursing home (housing status 2/2026; Maple Grove Care Center visits in 2026). |\n| pt-0035 Elvin Wolff | 68 | Open gap | No screening on record. His May 2026 nursing-facility stay was short-term rehab and he lives at home; he has no frailty diagnosis. Ordered FIT sr-t0006 and sent message comm-t0012. |\n\nTotals: 2 up to date, 7 open gaps (6 new FIT orders), 4 excluded, 1 not in the population.\n\nPt-0024 got no outreach message: the policy ties the message to a new order, and I found no earlier message about her existing kit. You may want to send her a reminder.",
